      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i know... people always say \"get help\" or \"be gentle with yourself\" but it doesnt actually change how heavy it is. it feels like im just pretending to live. like im just going through the motions so everyone else is happy but inside i'm just empty. it's like a constant, dull ache that never goes away no matter how much i sleep or \"rest\". it just feels like there's no point to any of it. does ever actually easier or are we just supposed to keep pretending isnlst exhausting",
